{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_4","type":"agent_message","text":"{\n  \"prompt\": \"Minecraft builder reference sheet, landscape 3:2. Vanilla Minecraft blocks only, crisp voxel style, plain light background, no characters or animals. Two views side by side: LEFT straight-on north front elevation, orthographic; RIGHT north-east three-quarter view at the same scale. Skilled human builder quality: real massing, projecting details, recessed and framed openings, stepped block arches, real roof verges, eaves and ridge, stairs, slabs, fences, walls, trapdoors and lanterns. Keep both views consistent. No smooth non-block curves. Small view labels only.\\n\\nSite: A big beige suburban McMansion on a cul-de-sac lot, seen from the street (north). 44 blocks wide, 32 deep, 2 storeys plus attic; main ridge y14, front gable y16, turret finial y17. The centrepiece is a tall white-trimmed front gable over a double-height portico: exactly four white quartz columns, a dark double front door with glass sidelights and an arched fanlight, a large arched Palladian window above it, and a half-round stepped-block window in the birch-beige gable. West (left in front elevation): octagonal two-storey turret bay with slate cone roof and lightning_rod finial. A big grey stone chimney rises up the west end wall. East (right): three-car garage wing, set back two blocks, exactly three dark spruce carriage doors made of spruce_trapdoor with glass_pane top lites, white headers, lanterns on stone piers, bonus room above with small shuttered windows. Lower front grey stone veneer up to white belt course; above it and on every other wall pale beige birch siding, white top plate and paired white quoins. Tall 2-wide arched windows with white sills and black shutters. Jumbled dark slate-grey asphalt-like hip roof built from deepslate, white dentil cornice, gable dormers at back, front gable and turret cone poking above. In front: wide pale concrete driveway, brick walk to portico steps, lamp p